WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.778
Skim each paragraph to find its purpose. The passage describes new library
services, an online reservation system, and challenges with digital access.

00:00:10.778 --> 00:00:22.412
Scan for the requested details. Library services are free. Study room
reservations are limited to two hours per person each day. Online booking has
reduced queues.

00:00:22.412 --> 00:00:35.335
Digital services do not suit everyone. Some visitors prefer help from a
librarian, while others have unreliable internet access. This explains why the
booking desk remains available.

